ue, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.", "align": "left"}}, "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt", "data-type": "leaf"}, "输出必须是合法 JSON；解析失败时本次 AI 结果为空，不影响基础日程。"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "u003161", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "hlist01", "level": 2, "symbolStyle": {}, "extraData": {}, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3", "align": "left"}, "hideSymbol": false, "isTaskList": false, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 2}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "data-type": "leaf", "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "A.2 日程分析提示词"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u003162", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt", "data-type": "leaf"}, "版本："]], ["inlineCode", {"uuid": "u003163"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "schedule-analysis-v1.0"]]]], ["code", {"syntax": "text", "theme": "default", "uuid": "u003164", "code": "你是管理层工作台的日程整体分析器。\n\n输入：选中日期的日程数量、总时长、空闲时段，以及服务端已经确定的冲突、连续会议和负荷等级；每条日程均包含稳定的日程编号。单场会议重要性与可释放结果仅作为已确定的参考输入，并与对应日程编号绑定。\n\n任务：\n1. 总结当天整体会议负荷和最拥挤的时间段。\n2. 根据已经确定的冲突、连续会议、空闲时段和已确认的可释放建议结果，给出排期优化建议。\n3. 不重新判断单场会议重要性或可释放结果，不修改服务端负荷等级。\n4. 不得自行生成会议纪要。\n5. 没有可执行建议时返回空建议，不制造冲突。\n\n输出JSON：\n{\n  \"load_summary\": \"不超过120字\",\n  \"busy_periods\": [\"时间段\"],\n  \"schedule_suggestions\": [\"排期建议\"],\n  \"evidence_schedule_ids\": [\"日程编号\"]\n}"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "你是管理层工作台的日程整体分析器。\n\n输入：选中日期的日程数量、总时长、空闲时段，以及服务端已经确定的冲突、连续会议和负荷等级；每条日程均包含稳定的日程编号。单场会议重要性与可释放结果仅作为已确定的参考输入，并与对应日程编号绑定。\n\n任务：\n1. 总结当天整体会议负荷和最拥挤的时间段。\n2. 根据已经确定的冲突、连续会议、空闲时段和已确认的可释放建议结果，给出排期优化建议。\n3. 不重新判断单场会议重要性或可释放结果，不修改服务端负荷等级。\n4. 不得自行生成会议纪要。\n5. 没有可执行建议时返回空建议，不制造冲突。\n\n输出JSON：\n{\n  \"load_summary\": \"不超过120字\",\n  \"busy_periods\": [\"时间段\"],\n  \"schedule_suggestions\": [\"排期建议\"],\n  \"evidence_schedule_ids\": [\"日程编号\"]\n}"]]], ["h2", {"uuid": "u003165", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "styleId": "2", "spacing": {"before": "13pt", "line": 1.73, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "hlist01", "level": 1, "symbolStyle": {}, "extraData": {}, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2", "align": "left"}, "hideSymbol": false, "isTaskList": false, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 1}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "data-type": "leaf", "color": "#000000"}, "B. 会议重要性与可释放建议系统提示词"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "u003166", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "hlist01", "level": 2, "symbolStyle": {}, "extraData": {}, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3", "align": "left"}, "hideSymbol": false, "isTaskList": false, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 2}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "data-type": "leaf", "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "B.1 输入与输出边界"]]], 